    "Potential roles include infrastructure component placement, industrial equipment erection and larger construction lifts. Defining the recurring lift cases with UHEEM helps select the appropriate configuration and supporting equipment. That approach gives an owner a clearer view of where the XCT110_Y1 belongs in the fleet and which projects it is intended to support.",
