    "The official specification lists a maximum theoretical spraying capacity of 30 m³/h, a maximum spraying height of 17 m and a forward spraying distance of 14 m. XCMG highlights stable positioning and a smooth spraying process. These features are relevant to consistent application, while actual output depends on the concrete, operating arrangement and conditions at the work face.",
    "Tunnel lining, underground support and suitable sprayed-concrete surfaces are practical applications to evaluate. Matching the working reach to the surface geometry helps establish where the machine can operate effectively. The concrete-supply and spraying sequence should be planned together, so the XS3017S supports the required application rather than waiting for material between passes.",
