    "The official Stage I model page describes hydraulic drive, electronically controlled shifting and hydraulic pilot blade control. It lists a 23,300 kg working-device weight configuration. These details place the machine in a substantial site-preparation role, with travel and blade functions coordinated for repeated pushing and spreading rather than loading material into a bucket.",
