    "Larger utility crossings and pipeline projects are relevant applications to assess. The rig should be matched to the bore design and anticipated pullback requirement, with the fluid system and pipe-handling equipment specified alongside it. This gives the XZ3000F a defined role within the project rather than treating the drilling rig as a standalone purchase.",
